# Helping Hand: "target creature card ... from your graveyard". Turn 3: Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Llanowar Elves and Faithless
# Looting discards Jacked Rabbit. Turn 5: the Elves, in Bot2's graveyard, cannot be targeted (CR 115.1); Jacked Rabbit
# can, and is the positive control. Bot2 answers by sacrificing Soul-Guide Lantern to exile Bot1's graveyard, so as
# Helping Hand resolves its only target is gone and it does nothing (CR 608.2b): no creature enters for Bot1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Faithless Looting
Jacked Rabbit
Helping Hand
Plains
Mountain
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island
Soul-Guide Lantern
Island x16

